l corrosive shot with your steamgun(s) at a target for %d%% weapon damage as acid.\n\t\tThe acid released by the shot will also corrode the target, reducing its accuracy, defense and armour by %d.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.\n\t\tCorrosion strength scales with Steampower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用蒸汽枪向目标发射一枚特殊腐蚀弹，造成 %d%% 酸性武器伤害。\n弹丸释放的酸液还会腐蚀目标，使其命中、闪避和护甲降低 %d 点。\n此技能不会消耗弹药，因为弹丸本身就是弹药。\n腐蚀强度随蒸汽强度提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4f13bc76e0130b2d7afbc845d254bfdf48078996acc3d171cf93e41237625e51","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"58e8027b42c8db598fc00fde32aac859ec2221112bc79f7076acc6a12bc36db0","logical_entry_identity":"ccff85e2bbbd81a50f55fe392d9cc2b3c55824dcb92061464f0964e496b2bd70","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Your knowledge of physical laws allows you to use and improve equipment in ways their creators never dreamed.\n\t\tIncreases all stats, saves, armour, and defense bonuses by %d%% on equipment that is crafted by a master or powered by steamtech.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你对物理学的了解令你能以全新的方式改进装备。\n\t\t增加大师制作或者蒸汽科技的装备提供的属性、豁免、护甲和闪避 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d51821ad2ad40d642dac14c6b8a2ff0b4fc5bf7ca6ff393dcd6b5b7c1b79e6e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"58fefd8e319421aa5b42b932da539a982d90aa4029796180ff2badc86d7300cf","logical_entry_identity":"613ed015b5c2c66c50972504bfd38d13a33e09deccf055a256b3437bc55b9ac0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"a journal (6)","source_tag":"_t","target":"一份日志 (6)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05f2fb9d4c90939bf18eae553946022dc3fe32e5eb19b878483f19cf5cf8c4e4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"59254697c101e97509436e274a8d086c69ae64bede412bfab6bdecd8c2c0db2b","logical_entry_identity":"d4fcc90b9f9efbf91f76541ee54ac15cc6c919c205f79d275e29076a615c96f9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sorry, I have to go!","source_tag":"_t","target":"抱歉，我要走了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e9fa40c74c51706a3