f the shunned and hunted minotaur race. Your tribe found a way to survive through necromancy.\n\nThe only race to ever show respect, if not kindness, to yours was the Orcs and now you found your tribe under the control of a mad leader.\nIf you help the Orcs with their problems you hope they will with yours; for the sake of both your kinds.\n\nYou have been sent to the Vaporous Emporium to wreak havoc and demoralize the giants.\nFor the Krimbul Clan !\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你，#LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#。\n你是生活在他人的贱视和追杀中的米诺陶一族。为了生存，你的部落使用了死灵魔法来改变自己。\n\n只有兽人是唯一对你们表示尊重的种族，然而，你们的部落正在被一位变得疯狂的领袖所控制。\n兽人是你们的盟友，你希望为了两个种族的共同利益能够和兽人互相帮助。\n\n你被送去蒸汽商场造成破坏以摧垮巨人们的士气。\n为了克里布尔部落！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"33bb869fe7d39498418f96aca1f5bb18d46cc52c9fd400fa896bf07122fee38a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5a9e6a5d14a5043e34d2d9c52e63acd7149ecb1cbc9dfd2747937a75cacae118","logical_entry_identity":"f55f03167bbb2bb66529ec1a1f0139b0c80751872da2d4740c3b98551288293d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"All Seeing","source_tag":"_t","target":"看穿一切"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d08fe86d29abb0e5653804fa367a77170c46a63a50048934f32ba633efb8cfd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5aa0d96d43285b3760eab11fa93513653b06e72759f7d140b49ac2eb9d2fcc73","logical_entry_identity":"feb8ebda74a5c1f5ea393c02cd741ca30d08d008d18feb5a2d8297fc3fe889ec","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"shock grenade","source_tag":"damage type","target":"震荡榴弹"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1a6e5bbedeaa2d8e8102a69d0dd2a8d5c662a7b0cda7b7a775308744e2be9217","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5aa87a5ed339cc15ff162eaba5cc691bdaa2b8d86f48c7a1190b4165beb32ba6","logical_entry_identity":"e43bc685ac2c78cd797e77326c6828f32d3fec28d3c4e76384f8fd67c815eb4d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target#'s AED deactivates.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的电击除颤器解除了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"097534afdd89b3a576651ee79e21df7263617c0e0173acd4c