":"_t","target":"蒸汽暴击几率："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5ee9689247a3bc28f12ea4eee941ed484f92483d29402a00b98f70c8ab8f1007","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5b2fe8667d96e56a17d291e9423e399e53a5604629d1aca66a106468d7963c25","logical_entry_identity":"2a7773ea4057aebed1eed10a5a4518e71ca0b307db3f55093f59923a178c610f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"X-Ray Goggles","source_tag":"entity name","target":"X射线护目镜"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d3bc2972dddfc8f3de65dc051961a4dad0944a2854bb315d0a10c574b8bbaed9","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5b4f8645e73890058fde318554ad0b0c35b69f7707fab9941acabea796746f7c","logical_entry_identity":"b207730b05f74a8297b3a9f8a32eeef7aafa35c3d9f8c34337083c0244725fa7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"A powerful salve that can clean magical detrimental effects from your body and grant a fiery aura (fire, light and lightning affinity).\nTo be used with the medical injector implant.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个可以清除你身上的负面魔法效果并获得一个烈火光环（火焰、光系、闪电伤害亲和）的强大药剂。\n需通过医疗注射器植入体使用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e212f93f5761c2074eb1ba667006aae1d5f884379fb239db3d6ae79e2f645d0e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5b6bfe93096ead2e24a19c302bd13ca36b1616e52ff662464bee2b693fef7017","logical_entry_identity":"06a02696c4f2bfd94f74516ada40fb77717ef8e0e492b7ec2c48eb21572df9ea","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"lump of dwarven steel","source_tag":"ingredient name","target":"矮人钢块"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e72d01d65fe9713e49fc296070d8d01eada1d702798ccad4a9b150f755521fb","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5b7667fbda132a08e46320ec0c4d9fc95d3ccf0478498ed508af9473f912d274","logical_entry_identity":"7e733e67e50733d3efadab57c7a5ef773b06e8d4238af2de3ceec713d73d04b5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"stack of herbs (viperweed)","source_tag":"entity name","target":"一束植物（蛇草）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"154f687cb6d43d6eb4979aaa46c9555b95462b314df1fa8c7cf400d46012b3cd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5b8e3a20957af422c0f96af8dd821f584cbd59516c12bf674be16d9089eee73a","logical_entry_identity":"531887b1fa105c4d77fa85a028d8b9663c4f87113f1145cf853eca20a4029b7a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Fire rate increases while firing, up to 5 shots per turn. Resets after 5 turns without firing.","source_tag":"_t","target":"攻击频率随着射击而增加，一回合最多射5次。5回合未射击则效果消失。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4ec820c9a3031c76671e008bf97770d6d92a75b938104d1ec36f518d3c80b83e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5bb123a6505c9eae2eebbbc5fd1c6ab6fa00de81af105ed7c3a1c499f062356a","logical_entry_identity":"63bc4ca9bfc60c4a6c8eaf28c856997a0585c06666a2b854d267594a1523eb5e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#PURPLE#Automated Reflex System activated!","source_tag":"saySimple","target":"#PURPLE#自动化反射系统启动！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ddc24d0378227a858021280ebe25ca85512dff2e1e22911bca66e9c6f31fcc5","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5bb911ddb970b1fd6a67a82a2cf176b3569816d5e219e231b18b5541d5a81411","logical_entry_identity":"d543c8fc0b058b446353fac6453f13023f67d91143471a96b5bfbc22f8429be5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You build %d micro spiderbot(s) from the earthly elements around you. Spiderbots are powered by an arcane cryogenic power unit directly linked to your own power.\n\t\tSpiderbots will deal %0.2f terrene damage (physical and cold) each turn to their targets. The deep cold of the attack has 25%% chance to freeze the feet of the target, pinning it to the ground for 5 turns.\n\t\tIf a target dies, the spiderbot will jump onto a new target in range %d around you.\n\t\tIf there are multiple spiderbots on a single target and more free targets are in range they will dispatch on as many as possible.\n\t\tIf there are multiple spiderbots on a single target they attack as one, stacking their damage (with disminishing returns) and trying to freeze once.\n\t\tYou can maintain up to %d spiderbots at once and each can last up to %d turns, but spiderbots need to be in sight to be able to act.\n\t\tThe cooldown of this spell is affected by Body of Stone.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\tYou have currently %d spiderbot(s) up.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用周围的土元素制造 %d 个迷你蜘蛛机器人。蜘蛛机器人是由和你的力量相连的奥术致冷单元驱动的。\n\t\t蜘蛛机器人每个回合会对它们的目标造成 %0.2f 寒岩（物理和寒冷）伤害。极寒的攻击有 25%% 的几率冻结目标的双脚，将他们定身 5 回合。\n\t\t如果目标被击杀了，蜘蛛机器人将会跳跃到你半径 %d 码范围内的另一个敌人身上。如果这个目标上有多个机器人，并且在范围内有足够多的可选目标，他们会尽可能分散地跳到每个敌人身上。\n\t\t如果一个目标的身上附身了多个蜘蛛机器人，他们会一起攻击，伤害会叠加（但收益递减），并且会一起试图冻结目标。\n\t\t你可以维持最多 %d 个蜘蛛机器人，他们最多存活 %d 回合。但是，只有在你视野范围内的蜘蛛机器人才会行动。\n\t\t这一技能的冷却时间受岩石身躯的影响。\n\t\t技能伤害受法术强度加成。\n\n\t\t你现在有 %d 个蜘蛛机器人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15fa62a1f3099e088f0ab7c7bc3d0f01caafd628bdb30f0b39a1e01fa86e3a1a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5bc1afc745976a8be2a8f0735a126c0672b4ed048eed30b56a85782e37c860fc","logical_entry_identity":"a702c5f2783bc981d973aaee32507d8c0f74a247db9136dc42b1494c529d3611","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"call a trained yeti for help","source_tag":"_t","target":"召唤受训练的雪人来帮助你"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c5efa4d80248329d926cf66edca78b91289c2d967b928171dd14946c9481b7bf","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5bf7662170b1271653e3f1388f7c9d9263d6efc3cb3785f8a763bb3f631a16dc","logical_entry_identity":"a7fd5dfe4c74cb7edd24d44b6761d05ffa5d3484810172d3b9aa604e069122f4","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Dominion Port: Tower","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨魔帝国港口：塔楼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1781cfcf45a27bb973880e022547a1dc96820f3543cb789eea56c54eddcf5229","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5bfa76cbadf4b6b4f3704fa0ff8fe979997b4d1006b4ef8a01e5b0054742f376","logical_entry_identity":"47180b5d7315c315c7f351609a1ada1ededc4b6b5211a40e903f49f7b681c1d2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"caustic steam","source_tag":"damage type","target":"腐蚀蒸汽"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf99a11efc65379fd12d1